      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>The shabbos table song “Yah Ekhsof No’am Shabbat” by Rabbi Aharon of Karlin, translated by Rabbi Morrison David Bial was first published in his anthology, <tei:hi rend="italic">An Offering of Prayer</tei:hi> (1962), p. 29-30, from where this translation was transcribed. I’ve added a line [in brackets] left untranslated by Rabbi Bial. –Aharon Varady</tei:p>
